[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0638","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0638.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0143","title":"Immunix Linuxconf vpop3d 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Linuxconf 1.23r 及更早版本中的 vpop3d 程序存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，诱使 vpop3d 程序以提升的权限写入攻击者指定的任意文件，从而导致系统文件被覆盖或破坏。该漏洞利用条件要求攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，且 vpop3d 程序以高权限运行。成功利用后可能导致系统服务异常或权限提升。CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0143"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45Z","remediation":"升级 linuxconf 至 1.19r2-4 及以上版本（Immunix OS 7.0-beta 对应补丁包 linuxconf-1.19r2-4_StackGuard_2），或安装 MandrakeSoft 安全公告 MDKSA-2001-011 提供的更新。如无法升级，确保 /tmp 目录挂载时使用 sticky 位（chmod 1777 /tmp）并启用 nosuid 选项，同时限制本地用户对 /tmp 的符号链接创建权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-011.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2186","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5923","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0143.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0143.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0143","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0143.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0143.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963310d0117c8de2c6908e6e4a8dba13966a88f4/2001/CVE-2001-0143.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0143.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0143.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0143.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0143.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0638.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0637","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0637.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0142","title":"Squid Squid 本地符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Squid 2.3 及更早版本在某些配置下存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接，诱使 Squid 代理服务在写入临时文件时覆盖系统任意文件，导致本地文件被篡改或破坏。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，且 Squid 配置中使用了不安全的临时文件处理方式，攻击条件较为受限，CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0142"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45Z","remediation":"升级到 Squid 2.4 及以上版本以修复临时文件符号链接攻击漏洞。Debian 用户可参考安全公告 DSA-019 通过 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade 更新 squid 软件包；Mandrake Linux 用户可参考 MDKSA-2001-003 更新至修复版本。如无法立即升级，应避免在 Squid 配置中使用不安全临时目录，并限制本地用户对 Squid 临时文件目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0212.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-019","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-003.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2184","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5921","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0142.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0142","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0142.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0142.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2001/CVE-2001-0142.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0142.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0142.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0142.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0142.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0142.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0637.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0636","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0636.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0140","title":"ARPWatch 2.1a4 本地符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"arpwatch 2.1a4 在特定配置下存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在临时目录中创建恶意符号链接，诱使 arpwatch 以特权进程身份向攻击者指定的任意文件写入数据，从而实现任意文件覆盖。该漏洞利用条件较高，需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限且系统配置存在缺陷，影响范围有限，仅对文件完整性造成部分破坏。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0140"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44Z","remediation":"将 arpwatch 升级至 2.1a10 或更高版本（该版本已使用 mkstemp 替代不安全的 mktemp 创建临时文件，消除符号链接竞争条件）。如无法升级，可将 arpwatch 临时文件目录改为仅 root 可写的私有目录（如 /var/lib/arpwatch/tmp），并确保 /tmp 分区挂载了 nosuid、noexec 选项以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-002.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2183","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5922","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0140.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0140","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0140.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0140.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0140.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2001/CVE-2001-0140.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0140.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0140.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0140.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0140.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0636.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0635","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0635.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0139","title":"immunix inn 符号链接任意文件写入漏洞","description":"INN (InterNetNews) 2.2.3 在特定配置下存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 INN 临时目录中创建恶意符号链接，诱使 INN 进程以提升的权限向任意文件写入数据，从而实现任意文件覆盖。该漏洞影响 INN 2.2.3 及可能受影响的 Immunix 等 Linux 发行版，攻击前提是攻击者拥有本地访问权限且系统配置了易受攻击的 INN 设置。由于 CVSS 评分仅 1.2，危害等级低，但成功利用可导致系统文件被篡改，进而可能引发权限提升或服务异常。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0139"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44Z","remediation":"建议将 INN (InterNetNews) 升级至 2.2.3-3 及以上版本，该版本已使用 mkstemp 替代不安全的 mktemp 函数，并将所有临时文件创建移至 INN 私有临时目录（如 /var/news/tmp），避免与系统共享临时目录的符号链接竞争。如无法升级，可手动将 INN 临时目录设置为仅 INN 用户可写（chmod 0700 /var/news/tmp），并在系统层面限制本地用户对 /tmp 的符号链接创建权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-001.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-010.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2190","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5916","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0139.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0139","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0139.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0139.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0139.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2001/CVE-2001-0139.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0139.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0139.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0139.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0139.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0635.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0634","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0634.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0138","title":"WU-FTPD wu-ftpd privatepw 符号链接攻击致任意文件写入漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd 2.6.1-6 之前版本中的 privatepw 程序存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过符号链接（symlink）攻击，在程序处理临时文件时诱导其向攻击者控制的路径写入数据，从而覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要本地用户权限，且无法直接获取机密信息或造成拒绝服务，但可破坏系统文件完整性，为后续提权攻击创造条件。CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0138"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44Z","remediation":"立即升级 wu-ftpd 至 2.6.1-6 或更高版本。Debian 用户可通过 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade wu-ftpd 安装安全更新 DSA-016；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-001 更新包。如无法升级，可移除 privatepw 程序的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/privatepw）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-016","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-001.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2189","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5915","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0138.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0138","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0138.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0138.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2001/CVE-2001-0138.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/12065efa5942c8c399e6c39fc2649ac2e94409b9/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0138.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0138.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0138.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0138.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0138.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0634.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0633","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0633.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0135","title":"Ultraboard Ultraboard 2000 目录权限不当漏洞","description":"Ultraboard 2000 2.11 默认安装后，Skins、Database 和 Backups 目录被设置为全局可写权限，导致本地攻击者无需认证即可修改敏感数据，甚至植入并执行恶意 CGI 脚本。该漏洞影响 Ultraboard 2000 2.11 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度低，可造成数据完整性破坏及潜在的代码执行风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0135"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44Z","remediation":"手动修改 Ultraboard 2000 安装目录下 Skins、Database 和 Backups 三个目录的权限为仅管理员可写（如 chmod 755），移除目录的全局可写权限，并检查是否存在被植入的恶意 CGI 脚本。建议迁移至受支持的论坛软件以获取安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97933458505857&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2197","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0135.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0135.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0135","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0135.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0135.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0135.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2001/CVE-2001-0135.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0135.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0135.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0135.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0633.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0632","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0632.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0132","title":"趋势科技 Interscan VirusWall 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 3.6.x 及更早版本在卸载产品时未正确处理符号链接，而是直接跟随指向的目标文件路径执行操作。本地低权限攻击者可预先创建指向系统关键文件的符号链接，当管理员执行产品卸载操作时，卸载程序会跟随该符号链接并覆盖目标文件，从而破坏系统文件完整性。该漏洞仅影响本地已登录用户，攻击需要较高复杂度（需配合管理员执行卸载流程），CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0132"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:43Z","remediation":"升级 Interscan VirusWall 至 Trend Micro 发布的修复版本（3.6.x 之后的版本），或应用 Trend Micro 官方安全补丁以消除卸载过程中跟随符号链接的风险。若无法立即升级，应暂时以 root 权限运行卸载程序，并在卸载前确保卸载目录下不存在任何可疑符号链接，同时限制普通本地用户对系统关键目录的写入权限，以降低符号链接攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0235.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2213","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0132.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0132.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0132","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0132.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0132.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0132.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/045dd815c5c9edb2f848de9196b8b22db27288ca/2001/CVE-2001-0132.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0132.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0132.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0132.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0632.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0631","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0631.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0126","title":"Oracle 8.1.7 XSQL Servlet 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.1.7 数据库中的 XSQL Servlet 组件（1.0.3.0 及更早版本）存在服务器端请求伪造与远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 xml-stylesheet 参数将 XSQL 服务器重定向至攻击者控制的恶意服务器，从而在目标系统上执行任意 Java 代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，影响 Oracle 8.1.7 及使用相关 XSQL Servlet 组件的应用系统，可导致敏感信息泄露、数据篡改或服务中断。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0126"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle XSQL Servlet 至 1.0.4.0 或更高版本，可从 Oracle Technology Network (otn.oracle.com) 获取。如无法立即升级，在所有 .xsql 页面文档元素中添加 allow-client-style=\"no\" 属性以禁用外部样式表加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97906670012796&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98027700625521&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5905","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0126.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0126.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0126","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0126.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0126.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0126.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/24bf8ab9ac19d70e8e7ca347101f59bbc2694f11/2001/CVE-2001-0126.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0126.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0126.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0126.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0631.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0631.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0631.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0630","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0630.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0125","title":"exmh 临时文件符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"exmh 2.2 及更早版本在处理临时文件时存在符号链接（symlink）攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 exmhErrorMsg 临时文件上创建符号链接，诱使 exmh 以当前用户权限覆盖任意系统文件，导致系统文件被篡改或数据损坏。该攻击需要本地用户权限，利用难度较高，但成功后可造成较大影响。受影响的系统包括 Debian、Mandrake Linux 等发行版。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0125"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42Z","remediation":"升级 exmh 至 2.3 或更高版本；Debian 用户安装 dsa-022 更新，Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-015 补丁。如无法升级，设置 TMPDIR 或 EXMHTMPDIR 环境变量指向用户自有目录以缓解 symlink 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2001-01/0543.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97846489313059&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97958594330100&w=2","http://www.beedub.com/exmh/symlink.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-022","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-015.php3","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5829","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0125.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0125","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0125.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0125.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/24bf8ab9ac19d70e8e7ca347101f59bbc2694f11/2001/CVE-2001-0125.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0125.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0125.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0125.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0125.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0125.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0630.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0629","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0629.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0124","title":"Sun Solaris exrecover 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.6 及更早版本中的 exrecover 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向该程序提交超长命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得提升的权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.6 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，成功利用后可获取目标系统的完全控制权（包括读取、修改和删除任意文件）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0124"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42Z","remediation":"立即移除 /usr/lib/exrecover 的 suid 权限：chmod u-s /usr/lib/exrecover。Solaris 2.6 及更早版本已停止支持，Oracle 不再提供安全补丁，建议升级到受支持的 Solaris 11.4 或更高版本。如无法升级，可通过限制本地用户登录或使用 RBAC 替代 suid 机制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97908386502156&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2179","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5913","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0124.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0124.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0124","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0124.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0124.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/24bf8ab9ac19d70e8e7ca347101f59bbc2694f11/2001/CVE-2001-0124.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0124.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0124.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0124.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0124.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0629.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0628","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0628.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0121","title":"Storagesoft ImageCast Control Center 4.1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Storagesoft ImageCast Control Center 4.1.0 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 TCP 端口 12002 发送超长字符串，触发服务端资源耗尽或系统崩溃，导致目标服务不可用。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 ImageCast 4.1.0 版本。厂商至今未发布官方补丁，建议通过防火墙限制对端口 12002 的访问以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0121"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41Z","remediation":"立即在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 12002 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。由于 Storagesoft ImageCast 4.1 已停止维护，建议升级至替代产品（如现代 PXE 部署方案），或将该服务隔离在独立网段中运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0071.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2174","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5901","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0121.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0121.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0121","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0121.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0121.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0121.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2001/CVE-2001-0121.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0121.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0121.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0121.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0628.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0627",